# Local scratch/debug harnesses (never shipped). The frontend has had this since
# it lost the same argument; a throwaway app for poking one function by hand gets
# committed by mistake far more often than it gets deleted.
_scratch*.py
scratch-*.py
# Local SQLite databases. The suite runs in-memory, but pointing DATABASE_URL at
# a file is the normal way to inspect one by hand, and the resulting .db is a
# runtime artifact — never source.
*.db
